# ============================================================================
# Custom map zoom regions for plot_case_study.py --zoom
# ============================================================================
# Copy this file to `custom_areas.yaml` (same folder) and add your own named
# areas below. They are merged into the built-in ZOOM_REGIONS automatically
# at startup and become available immediately as `--zoom <name>` — no code
# change needed. A name here with the same key as a built-in area overrides it.
#
# Format: name: [lon_min, lon_max, lat_min, lat_max]
#
# Example (uncomment and edit):
# iberia: [-10, 4, 36, 44]
# alps:   [5, 16, 44, 48]
